				""
				"&5Arkback do not attack you unless you attack first. They ignore all knockback, so don't rely on that for your strategy."
				""
				"&5Arkbacks can drop Armour Plating and Hive Chunks. Both are good for crafting, but the Hive Chunk especially is needed for facing one of the FOP Corporate Bosses."
