		{
			title: "Squiggler and Tharafly"
			x: 7.75d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&5Squigglers are creatures that can rarely spawn underground."
				""
				"&5If you are within line of sight of a Squiggler and they are close enough, they will set you on fire."
				""
				"&5Tharaflies are creatures that spawn on the surface of Barathos, and also in Baron Castles that can be found on the surface likewise."
				""
				"&5Tharaflies are flying creatures, and are considered Arthropods, so Bane of Arthropods will work on them."
				""
