		{
			title: "Attracting the Leaders"
			x: 8.75d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dNow then, time to consider grabbing the attention of the two FOP Corporate Bosses here."
				""
				"&5To your benefit, Bandit, they don't quite get along. They were both assigned to head the same Sales team. But instead of having HR fix it..."
				""
				"&d...they split the team in half and began a war on each other. Seeing which team could sell the most product, using every underhanded tactic they could..."
				""
				"&5Well, aside from outright murdering the other team. It got close. But I think we can use this to our advantage, we just need the right items..."
				""
				"&dFor the Baroness, you'll need to make a Warlock Gem, an item of power."
				""
				"&5And the Hive King will need a Hive Egg. You can get this by taking a Hive Chunk and HITTING a Tharafly with it. Literally, smack it with the Hive Chunk."
			]
			dependencies: ["783B07D340595603"]
			id: "09D75AF35A485E3C"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "143984A408594E19"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:warlock_gem"
				}
				{
					id: "304941DB058D1F50"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:hive_egg"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "3B8207D165C72573"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Sales Hawk"
			x: 9.75d
			y: -3.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&dThe Baroness was a stern old hawk even before the Sales Wars took place. She belittled all the staff under her until they either did as she said, or left. "
				""
				"&5And if you followed her orders, she swapped to honeyed words. Teaching others to be as sharp and wiley as her with their sales tactics. "
				""
				"&dBut a wrong move would incur a whiplike lashing of words. And demerits. "
				""
				"&5With the Sales Wars, she became even sharper and angrier. She earned herself the title of Archwitch from other sales teams, and both her and the Hive King were allowed to become FOP Game Server bosses, as long as they shared the same world and continued to fight."
				""
				"&dSomehow their fighting was profitable, at least to the FOP."
			]
			dependencies: ["09D75AF35A485E3C"]
			id: "73F19D407DDBD157"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7C7083A3038EA64B"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:warlock_gem"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Sales Bull"
			x: 9.75d
			y: -0.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&dThe Hive King was a bullheaded manager in Sales, usually getting his way by just barreling over the competition."
				""
				"&5He got everything done by basically strongarming and overpowering folks, or making them think he would. Very intimidating fellow."
				""
				"&dHe got all his sales workers on his side, using his own bullying tactics. And when you have a lot of force, you join them or you move aside. "
				""
				"&5Thats why he got the nickname The Swarm Leader. And why he was allowed to become a FOP Corporate Boss in the game, sheer numbers on his side."
			]
			dependencies: ["09D75AF35A485E3C"]
			id: "26932C5205630A14"
			tasks: [{
				id: "71D1D3B23826ADE6"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:hive_egg"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "THE BARONESS"
			x: 10.75d
			y: -4.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&dIf you are intent on facing The Baroness, you'll want to be prepared."
				""
				"&5Make sure you are resistant to explosions and fire, as her favorite tactic involves lots of both."
				""
				"&dTo summon her, you'll need to find one of her arenas. They are large platforms high up atop a tall spire. In the center is a Baroness Altar. Right Click the Warlock Gem onto it and she'll appear with a big BOOM."
				""
				"&5As you fight, be careful. Getting TOO close will cause her to use explosion spells to push you away."
				""
				"&dShe'll also drop Baroness Bombs, that will explode after a bit, and possibly set things on fire."
				""
				"&5Bandit, be sure to put those fires out fast if she's about dead. She's been known to throw her prized posessions into them at the last moment. That includes her Boss Card."
			]
			dependencies: ["73F19D407DDBD157"]
			id: "14A7C949E30659BE"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "38B15409E01476DC"
					type: "item"
