		{
			title: "HIVE KING"
			x: 10.75d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&dWanting to face the Hive King? You better be prepared to fight an army as well, Bandit."
				""
				"&5As you fight the Hive King, he'll start summoning his troops now and then. They don't have a ton of health, but they all hit like a truck if you aren't careful."
				""
				"&dIf you are ready, look for the spheres all around, the ones with the bottoms cut off. Those are Hive Nests. In the center is a Hive Spawner, which you want to Right Click the Hive Egg onto. This will start to summon the Hive King."
				""
				"&5Don't hit him while he's showing up. That just annoys him and he'll leave immediately."
			]
