		{
			title: "Feeding the Beasts"
			x: 10.75d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS BRIBE"
			description: [
				"&dFighting a bull headed boss is the simplest, and also most difficult choice. It's hard to reason with them..."
				""
				"&5And it can be detrimental to your health."
				""
				"&dSo, for the Hive King, we've worked out how to appease him. With, of course, food."
				""
				"&5Not for him though. For his Swarm. Despite being absolutely bullheaded, the Hive King knows his Swarm needs to eat to live and work for him. So, giving a whole lot of food items should do well."
				""
				"&dMake sure the meats are not cooked. The fish can be however, though. Also some fruits and veggies for good measure."
				""
				"&5Oh, and some nuts! And cakes too!"
			]
