		{
			title: "A Special Mineral Shop"
			x: 5.25d
			y: -5.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dWell well, look at this thing, Bandit. The Baroness calls it a \"Mineralization Station\"."
				""
				"&dIn her war efforts against the Hive King, she needs all the gems and metals she can get, so she offers a better 'deal' to Users than the FOP base game does. "
				""
				"&dYou can Right Click most any Advent of Ascension Gem or Metal Ingot onto the Mineralization Station to 'sell' it for some Scrypto. Usually gets you more coins than the FOP Digitalization system does."
				""
				"&dYou can find these at the top of the tall Baron Towers you can find in Barathos."
			]
			dependencies: ["2F80E867398F3D43"]
