		{
			title: "Land so Dark"
			x: 3.25d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&dThe Deeplands is just as it says, a very deep, very dark cave system. The entire world. "
				""
				"&5The surface was featureless and barren, so the FOP decided to just cover the world in Dimensional Fabric, which keeps its inhabitants on."
				""
				"&dThe world is dotted with crystal lights here and there, but I wouldn't rely on them, especially if you go exploring. "
				""
				"&5Some Night Vision Goggles are a good idea. Or a bunch of potions. "
			]
			dependencies: ["20DC9D8BCD99C99E"]
			id: "35BD227E22471442"
			tasks: [{
				id: "066F276AE68431A3"
				type: "dimension"
				title: "Travel to the Deeplands"
				dimension: "aoa3:deeplands"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "541B4A6F7191F0C3"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "A Case of the Endless"
			x: 5.75d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dThere isn't much in the way of resources here, Bandit, but what there is is enough of an interest to the FOP to set it into their world rotation."
				""
				"&5Charged Runium Ore is a rarer version of the Runium Ore you can find in the Overworld. It's best used for making more Runes, of course."
				""
				"&dAs well as other things. You'll also find Rune Cases, strange blocks that look like they have a face on them. Mostly underground."
				""
				"&5These are like little treasure chests in a way. Mining them may get you some Scrypto, or Runium, or..."
				""
				"&d...rarely a nice weapon or two."
			]
			dependencies: ["35BD227E22471442"]
			id: "7D01A63A702AA3E4"
			tasks: [{
				id: "690D9E091A4ACDA7"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:charged_runium_ore"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "22B6BEAB3350B849"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Darkness Charged"
			x: 8.75d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dOne of the things you'll want to keep a look out for, Bandit, is a Charging Table. You can find them in Charging Fountains, which you can spot from a distance as they are pretty boxy looking structures, so they stand out."
				""
				"&5Be sure to grab it when you see it, it's the first step in facing the FOP Corporate Boss of the Deeplands."
			]
			dependencies: ["7D01A63A702AA3E4"]
			id: "3519F34D2E8B2116"
			tasks: [{
				id: "26DEBD0694ABAD9E"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:charging_table"
			}]
			rewards: [{
