				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Grabbing Attention"
			x: 9.75d
			y: 3.0d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&dThe FOP Corporate Boss here is known as The Stone Giant. They got their name for being VERY TALL, as well as being very stoney in their stare."
				""
				"&5Said that their stare was so heavy that competition just kinda got rolled over by it. Unable to break that solid, unrelenting gaze."
				""
				"&dA stone cold glare from a very tall boss, that's a triple whammy there. "
				""
				"&5Well if you want to get Kror, the Stone Giant's attention, you'll need to make something nice and heavy and meaningful to them."
				""
				"&dThe Boulder Dash was a trophy they got for skipping rocks as a kid. Kind of an odd thing to have a contest over, but sounds kinda fun."
				""
				"&5I wonder if they were always tall for their age, or if they had a big growth spurt as a teenager?"
			]
			dependencies: ["3519F34D2E8B2116"]
			id: "5497CCB6AC167995"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6BA74B0BD40E0939"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:boulder_dash"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "32F1B96C31C8E096"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "KROR"
			x: 11.25d
			y: 1.75d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&dIf you want to fight Kror, you'll need to find a cave down to their Altar. Be sure to bring the Charging Station and a Boulder Dash!"
				""
				"&5Place the Charging Station onto the Kror Altar, then Right Click the Boulder Dash onto the Charging Altar."
				""
				"&dYou don't want to rely on knockback in this fight, Bandit. Cause you aren't gonna be knocking the Stone Giant around, period."
				""
				"&5They also have fairly tough skin, and any ranged damage done with bows or guns will be halved."
				""
				"&dMelee is going to be your best bet, but be careful, getting smacked by Kror will slow you down a lot."
			]
			dependencies: ["5497CCB6AC167995"]
