			description: [
				"&dBack in business! Now that you got the Orange Dimension DLC, you can get the next step closer to getting out of there."
				""
				"&5And take apart the FOP in the process."
				""
				"&dYou'll want to make a little pit stop in The End, one of the original dimensions of the game server. "
				""
				"&5You'll want to face the Ender Dragon at some point, but you don't have to yet. Lot's more interesting things than facing an old foe."
				""
				"&dThough with some of the weaponry the FOP introduced in newer dimensions, the Ender Dragon is... well, it probably hasn't been updated in a while. Let's just say that."
